For each reactive molecule, the atom, bond, angle, etc... types are defined (Figure \ref{fig:evb.par1}).  The variables "OW", "HW", "OH-HW", "HW-OW-HW", etc... are not necessary, but prove helpful in keeping the contents of the remaing portion of this file organized. The last line of the "in.evb" file references the "evb.par\_4amber" file that will be included as part of the "in.evb" file. The parameter file contains all definitions relating to the chemical reactions that will be simulated and is discussed in the next section.
