   10.8831327     : P'
   10.0380922     : a
   1.8136426      : r0_oo

 : Potential part
   -23.1871874        : vij_const, in kcal/mol
     1                : if contains Vij_ex part
         
  : exchanged charge
   H2O  H3O : Types of molecule_A (Water) and molecule_B (Hydronium)

   -0.0895456
    0.0252683
    0.0252683
   -0.0895456
    0.0780180
    0.0252683
    0.0252683  
  #endif

  #ifdef EVB2
  : parameters
   1.85           : gamma
   0.27           : P
